# Post processing script to auto send staged jobs to filament-manager

https://github.com/TimothyLai77/filament-manager

Example usage in orcaslicer's post processing: `"/path/to/filament.py" <https://filamentmanager.example.com/api/stagedjobs/>`
On windows there's an exe file with everything packaged so: `"Path\To\filament.exe" <https://filamentmanager.example.com/api/stagedjobs/>`
